post-it: Visual artifacting
cause: Overheated GPU
symptoms:
	Garbled picture
	Colours look wrong
checks:
	yes: Coloured blocks and torn lines on screen
		shows: from power-on
	yes: Scorched GPU heatsink
		shows: in the Workview
	no: Picture is clean
hardware steps:
	Open case
	Trash the GPU
	Fit a new GPU
	Close case
